[Heidi] Wow.
[Evan] It should be fun.

711
00:31:00,566 --> 00:31:01,567
I don't know if you're--
But anyway,

712
00:31:01,651 --> 00:31:03,611
they are thinking about
adding you to the call sheet tomorrow,

713
00:31:03,694 --> 00:31:05,655
so, if you could be on stand-by,
that would be great.

714
00:31:05,738 --> 00:31:07,115
-Sure! Thank you.
-Cool.

715
00:31:07,198 --> 00:31:09,117
-Hopefully we'll see you soon.
-Yeah, have a good night.

716
00:31:10,201 --> 00:31:11,411
-Hey!
-[Heidi] Hi! Oh, my...

717
00:31:11,494 --> 00:31:13,997
-Oh, my God.
-Oh, my God, thank you.

718
00:31:14,080 --> 00:31:15,665
-Yeah! No, of course.
-[sighs]

719
00:31:15,748 --> 00:31:16,832
I'm glad it worked out.

720
00:31:16,917 --> 00:31:18,834
-Yeah.
-And that you didn't kill anybody.

721
00:31:18,919 --> 00:31:20,295
-I know! I know!
-[laughing]

722
00:31:20,378 --> 00:31:22,255
-Yay, me!
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

723
00:31:22,338 --> 00:31:23,339
Oh, wow.

724
00:31:23,423 --> 00:31:24,757
-Um... Yeah.
-That was amazing.

725
00:31:24,840 --> 00:31:28,636
I think, um, they're actually talking
about adding me to another episode.

726
00:31:28,719 --> 00:31:31,932
-Oh, wow! That's cool.
-I think. It's so crazy.

727
00:31:32,015 --> 00:31:34,059
Um, do you wanna get a drink?

728
00:31:34,142 --> 00:31:37,603
Um... Uh, I actually already have plans...

729
00:31:37,687 --> 00:31:39,355
-Oh, okay.
-...for tonight.

730
00:31:39,439 --> 00:31:41,691
-Oh! Okay. [laughs]
-So, yeah... No, no, no.

731
00:31:41,774 --> 00:31:43,401
-It's so late. Okay.
-Yeah. Yeah, uh...

732
00:31:43,484 --> 00:31:44,945
Couldn't-- Can't flake out.

733
00:31:45,028 --> 00:31:46,947
I guess I'll see you, uh,
the next time I shoot?

734
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:49,032
Yes! That's right.

735
00:31:49,115 --> 00:31:50,951
-Yeah, definitely. Definitely, okay.
-Same time, same place.

736
00:31:51,034 --> 00:31:52,743
-Well, probably a different time.
-All right.

737
00:31:52,827 --> 00:31:53,995
You know that. [laughs]

738
00:31:54,079 --> 00:31:56,247
-Okay.
-All right. Gotta run. Okay.

739
00:31:56,331 --> 00:31:58,333
[Andy coughing]

740
00:31:58,416 --> 00:32:01,002
Dude, I'm, like, really glad that we met.

741
00:32:01,086 --> 00:32:03,254
But I am never doing this again.

742
00:32:04,255 --> 00:32:05,715
Well, I might. [laughs]

743
00:32:05,798 --> 00:32:06,799
[Mickey laughs]

744
00:32:06,882 --> 00:32:08,426
Um, what about meetings?

745
00:32:08,509 --> 00:32:09,552
What meetings do you go to?

746
00:32:09,635 --> 00:32:12,222
I usually go to that one
in the church on Hillhurst.

747
00:32:13,848 --> 00:32:18,769
There's one tomorrow at, uh, the YMCA.
Sunset and Alvarado.

748
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:20,063
You wanna meet there?
Noon. Tomorrow.

749
00:32:20,146 --> 00:32:21,356
-Yeah, I could do that.
-You wanna meet there?

750
00:32:21,439 --> 00:32:22,482
-Mmm-hmm.
-Yeah?

751
00:32:22,565 --> 00:32:24,192
[sighing]
Jesus, what the fuck do I do now?

752
00:32:24,275 --> 00:32:26,987
Just get an Uber.
Go home and go to sleep.

753
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:29,030
No, I-- [sighs]

754
00:32:29,114 --> 00:32:30,156
Okay.

755
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,242
Hey, how 'bout, uh...
you want to share an Uber and...

756
00:32:32,325 --> 00:32:33,368
[stuttering]

757
00:32:34,744 --> 00:32:36,537
...come to my place, crash out?

758
00:32:38,623 --> 00:32:41,876
How about we share an Uber,
and go to your place, crash out?

759
00:32:41,959 --> 00:32:42,961
It's not gonna happen.

760
00:32:43,044 --> 00:32:44,379
No, I'm not saying it's gonna,
I'm just-- Okay.

761
00:32:44,462 --> 00:32:46,339
-Oh, shit.
-Oh, you got reception finally?

762
00:32:46,422 --> 00:32:47,423
Look at all these texts.

763
00:32:47,507 --> 00:32:49,009
What-- Who is it?
Can I get a ride?

764
00:32:49,092 --> 00:32:50,426
That dude, Gus.

765
00:32:51,344 --> 00:32:53,346
-Maybe he can give us a ride.
-[laughs]

766
00:33:08,361 --> 00:33:09,654
[Andy] I really did have a good time.

767
00:33:09,737 --> 00:33:10,738
[Mickey] Me, too.
[Andy] Okay.

768
00:33:10,821 --> 00:33:11,864
[Mickey] All right, I'll see you tomorrow.

769
00:33:11,947 --> 00:33:13,033
[Andy] Yeah. Thanks, baby.

770
00:33:13,116 --> 00:33:14,825
[Mickey] Bye!
[Andy] Bye!

771
00:33:15,743 --> 00:33:17,328
[cell phone chiming]

772
00:33:22,792 --> 00:33:24,002
[chuckles]

773
00:33:26,879 --> 00:33:28,005
[cell phone vibrates]

774
00:33:34,762 --> 00:33:35,930
[cell phone chimes]

775
00:33:42,437 --> 00:33:43,563
[cell phone rings]

776
00:33:43,646 --> 00:33:46,357
-Hey.
-[Gus] Hey. I'm so sorry about everything.

777
00:33:46,441 --> 00:33:47,567
No, I'm sorry.

778
00:33:47,650 --> 00:33:50,903
Like, I was in this bar,
and I had no reception,

779
00:33:50,986 --> 00:33:53,573
and I'm just now walking home.

780
00:33:53,656 --> 00:33:55,491
No, no, no.
It's cool.

781
00:33:55,575 --> 00:33:57,993
I'm-- I'm sorry.
I felt like I was the one who was...

782
00:33:58,078 --> 00:33:59,120
[sighs]

783
00:33:59,204 --> 00:34:00,205
fucking up. [laughs]

784
00:34:00,288 --> 00:34:02,832
I guess we're both fuck-ups.
So it's cool.

785
00:34:02,915 --> 00:34:06,586
If you do wanna try this again--
You don't have to, but I do, uh...

786
00:34:06,669 --> 00:34:09,589
Maybe we should pick an earlier time,
like 7:00?

787
00:34:09,672 --> 00:34:14,177
Oh, 7:00? That's not, um... that's not
too proper for you or anything, or...

788
00:34:14,260 --> 00:34:15,261
[laughs]

789
00:34:15,345 --> 00:34:16,929
Fuck it, I mean, I'll do 6:00.

790
00:34:17,012 --> 00:34:20,308
Oh, yeah?
[scoffs] Hey, I'll do 5:00.

791
00:34:20,391 --> 00:34:22,102
Hey, make it 4:00, bitch!

792
00:34:22,185 --> 00:34:25,146
Uh, yeah, let's do 4:00 then.
[sighs]

793
00:34:25,230 --> 00:34:27,773
-All right. Good night, Gus.
-Bye.

794
00:34:30,818 --> 00:34:31,819
[sighs]

795
00:34:40,495 --> 00:34:42,497
[acoustic music playing]

